[{"title":"上海胡家闸茶楼","author":"林旭","text":"已近乡心那得休，谁曾一笑妄成留。\n依回避疫情何怯，牵率言欢意易酋。\n十里人声趋短夜，百年海水变东流。\n闲来独倚原无事，只为凉风爱此楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42908,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"还福州海行两首 其一","author":"林旭","text":"客吴思越此成回，云水多情识我来。\n白氎千重遮日走，绿荷万顷泛风开。\n车音听入江干别，亭树归寻旧月栽。\n仰屋波光看不定，顿思微醉玩深杯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42909,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"还福州海行两首 其二","author":"林旭","text":"属水云垂日半黄，峰峦渐熟却深藏。\n轾轩岂是人能使，俯仰翻嗤山太忙。\n旱疫应知乡事苦，藩杝未识国谋臧。\n坐窗兀兀真当瘦，不为微生感独长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42910,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"福州寄内","author":"林旭","text":"人海投身未作谋，多君送我思何周。\n江干灯火残宵月，客里林园临别游。\n携手何当歌有道，客居聊得顾无忧。\n入关志气无能励，望远凭高莫自愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42911,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"八月十四夜拔可宅中露台","author":"林旭","text":"家山风物别成忘，良夜乘高试一望。\n月静方知双塔闹，雾低惟觉满城香。\n惊枝群鸟难安梦，闻笛离人易断肠。\n直恨清辉同万里，谁言秋思在他乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42912,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与拔可别后却寄","author":"林旭","text":"少年为道欲安心，莫以端居儗陆沈。\n丛桂小山真好住，白华处子孰能侵。\n书声课弟灯初上，竹影关门雨自深。\n新为高斋作寂寞，据梧不共夜分吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42913,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再寄拔可并讯仲奋","author":"林旭","text":"客还孤陋少情亲，厚我犹夸李与陈。\n绝羡杀鸡人有母，直呼作黍孰为宾。\n欲言已尽原堪去，相见方秋更待春。\n路曲树阴压清泚，记同诗客访经神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42914,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄陈仲奋 其一","author":"林旭","text":"谋身或未能，辄有当世意。\n夫子悯其狂，登高共一慨。\n山河犹吾土，胡为视若异。\n珠玉久不生，凄怆少辉媚。\n呜呼谁始然，已矣非人事。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42915,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄陈仲奋 其二","author":"林旭","text":"吾党二三子，望古期一至。\n卓哉岂不贤，行处人或避。\n群阴方剥阳，山高不绝地。\n政使随俗耳，谁得谓非智。\n烦君但一计，何以安吾睡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42916,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丁酉九日泊舟烟台寄鹤亭二首 其一","author":"林旭","text":"别君若翌日，登舟作重九。\n万里好家山，翩然得我友。\n主人掩户出，巨盗窥所有。\n已去俄复来，居心疑不厚。\n莫谓国无人，一旦落君手。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42917,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丁酉九日泊舟烟台寄鹤亭二首 其二","author":"林旭","text":"落叶未足悲，睹寒情一至。\n孰云东邻女，不下阮生泪。\n此意旋自隐，妄谓止礼义。\n不图扬其波，乃使惭无地。\n泥犁诚对簿，君亦无所利。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42918,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"呈黄太守国成","author":"林旭","text":"戴义全家未敢諠，十年事往尚烦言。\n同舟有剑伤孤按，入井无绳赖手援。\n当日一舟推直道，古人驷马望公门。\n心知邂逅非容易，恐是先灵诱幼孙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42919,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邻鹤吟","author":"林旭","text":"剑题寖贵采，鹤唳延悲声。\n西邻有羁客，闻之绕室行。\n已无亲手饲，宁为告饥鸣。\n努力谓欲去，恩义怀无声。\n叶落树寡色，露寒天不明。\n婵娟掩中户，蝙蝠飞前荣。\n华表归来日，相逢或一惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42920,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"代书与里中亲友","author":"林旭","text":"推户惊风大，听诗闻雨来。\n五年终夕话，三客异乡回。\n欢阻河塍月，心伤里社灾。\n别怀知未释，寄与短章开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42921,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戊戌元日江亭即事","author":"林旭","text":"倚阑云起乱鸦呼，黯黯西山望未无。\n乍入闇虚惟夕景，还连风色落平芜。\n主忧避殿当元日，臣职操兵见啬夫。\n如我闲官神所笑，何祥欲问自疑迂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42922,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同陈清湘饮唐沽酒楼 其一","author":"林旭","text":"幰幰船行烟尚屯，萧萧旗响水争喧。\n吴儿涕泣君休笑，忍见邢贞入国门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42923,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同陈清湘饮唐沽酒楼 其二","author":"林旭","text":"杜陵家室吾方问，通德乡门子自昌。\n逆旅匆匆聊命酒，相逢莫道马宾王。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42924,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄内 其一","author":"林旭","text":"晓色惊看月满窗，池廊雨歇水淙淙。\n酒醒作痛何情绪，梦见吴淞十里江。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42925,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄内 其二","author":"林旭","text":"六月长安无一事，借人庭馆看西山。\n鹿车是处堪同挽，留滞何因却未还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42926,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同琴南拔可稚辛至云栖寺题名而去","author":"林旭","text":"江路山光百转新，灵关云木倏相亲。\n全收雄突归深窈，不露庄严自淑真。\n修翠含阴留宿润，杂花浮水散幽春。\n谁知未是逃名处，尚有庭前泚笔人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42927,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"礼莲池大师塔","author":"林旭","text":"天外飞禽逐磬音，石坛幡影见深深。\n诗人宿具开山手，世难旋移卜隐心。\n老树刺天青自直，空潭留日绿还沈。\n有情多是栖栖者，初地微茫岂易寻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42928,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酬徵宇江亭谈诗见赠","author":"林旭","text":"论诗如文教多派，能驿众家即无害。\n孤生为盗颇自封，比来稍欲观其外。\n几人南郭空连墙，谁士郯途忽倾盖。\n细思离合似有缘，妄生分别旋自戒。\n迢遥上奉一诗王，四国交侵无经界。\n龂龂执律欲正谁，空使达人笑多怪。\n感君广我用意多，惟是褊心将永赖。\n夜窗病渴玉泉乾，三复佳章舌根沛。\n日夕西山在眼中，此乃吾家真晚翠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42929,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"呈太夷丈","author":"林旭","text":"闻命书思既竭才，池亭起早独裴回。\n寒生晓梦知方雨，雷转秋阴喜渐开。\n救伪未妨行督责，乘时自合仗雄材。\n先生平日吾师事，试问如何区画来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42930,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"颐和园葵花","author":"林旭","text":"瀛海分馀润，秋晖亦圣恩。\n抚心无愧汝，飘落复何言。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42931,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"狱中示复生","author":"林旭","text":"青蒲饮泣知何补，慷慨难酬国士恩。\n欲为君歌千里章，本初健者莫轻言。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42932,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补遗宜州作","author":"林旭","text":"便当西去蹑深幽，古佛精蓝在上头。\n应被山灵笑逋客，已输群从擅清游。\n枯肠准备酬高唱，傲趣宁须托故邱。\n拟向三游乞泉水，清泠稍为涤尘愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42933,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉后赋谢","author":"林旭","text":"不醉复何事，能狂亦自佳。\n知应烦地主，稍得散闲怀。\n欢笑春生座，徘徊月上阶。\n可怜无赖意，病酒早安排。\n侯舟行未得，留滞亦徒然。\n豪饮又今夕，沈吟忆昔年。\n云山违咫尺，聚散误因缘。\n不惜扶残醉，还为拂画笺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42934,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再赋二律 其一","author":"林旭","text":"去灯为妨月，被酒但呼茶。\n憔悴空如此，婵娟共几家。\n能豪感同辈，极意惜年华。\n便作伤心语，旁人莫道差。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42935,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再赋二律 其二","author":"林旭","text":"此间频作客，惭愧累华筵。\n得句劳相慰，纵谈忘失眠。\n未胜贱子感，多谢大家贤。\n来日沧江去，虚留惜往篇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42936,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即景作","author":"林旭","text":"日光欲下却徘徊，雪意成阴总不开。\n已是寂寥当腊尽，好教点缀待春回。\n流连岁事谁拼酒，料理诗怀及看梅。\n相聚差无流寓感，肯为觅句费清才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42937,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉酬彦修","author":"林旭","text":"神龙不见飞腾迹，健力有如作诗客。\n郑郎学古穷攀追，挥斥阳阿谢为役。\n夷陵作客足诗情，春来应折游山屐。\n嗟予逐队走红尘，天涯忽觉吟身只。\n把玩君诗欣叹兼，多谢深情慰迢隔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42938,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"又赠七绝一首","author":"林旭","text":"雅量如君信有馀，论诗那得涉阶除。\n少年同学多文藻，若说沈思总不如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42939,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲午春闱报罢路过武昌为郑叔昭内兄题芙蕖箑面","author":"林旭","text":"羞将涂抹侪凡艳，自有芬芳入妙文。\n心绪即今渐摇落，秋江无那又逢君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42940,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠筱蜦 其一","author":"林旭","text":"三朝坐甲帐，十载雪霜寒。\n瑶台此中是，何处学骖鸾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42941,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠筱蜦 其二","author":"林旭","text":"不如径输情，玉台免簿责。\n彦回羞见人，障面了何益。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42942,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠筱蜦 其三","author":"林旭","text":"腊酒及团圞，新春增婉娈。\n益寿故自佳，何物近禁脔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42943,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱","author":"项琨","text":"浅碧罗云晕缕霞。\n参差楼阁绿杨遮。\n月痕黄淡一钩斜。\n网户掠飞归乳燕，涨池新浴乱娇鸦。\n粉墙红压紫薇花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42944,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"满江红","author":"项琨","text":"第一山前，问业案、何时销歇。\n摩莎处、藓碑青字，吊凭英烈。\n铁绠秋沉泥马渡，金牌夜梦黄龙月。\n底白头、有客在驴鞍，空凄切！\n东窗愤，还谁雪。\n南枝恨，终难灭。\n算千年、钟室堕瓯同缺。\n二帝无灵驼溅泪，六陵有树鹃啼血。\n叹皋亭、风雨岳家旗，悲天阙！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42945,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昔梦四首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"无憀还有恨，惜别复伤春。\n欲织红鸳锦，亲镂绿玉尘。\n扣云通一语，烧烛掩孤颦。\n虚负瑶华梦，年年芳意新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42946,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昔梦四首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"忧患浮生事，还来读道书。\n银灯消昔梦，华屋及春居。\n寂历旧情谢，萧条清夜沮。\n行郎空柘弹，归马欲踌躇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42947,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昔梦四首 其三","author":"曾习经","text":"蝶粉轻难触，龙香瘦自持。\n他时曾病酒，安坐且调丝。\n子夜沉沉去，年芳故故迟。\n琼瑰化清泪，不惜为酬伊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42948,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昔梦四首 其四","author":"曾习经","text":"白马从骊驹，垂垂倒玉鱼。\n后门花月散，初日凤凰雏。\n浊水清尘感，凄馨艳怨图。\n未愁芳物尽，待寄陆郎书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42949,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"腊梅诗","author":"曾习经","text":"水晶欲刻鸳鸯翅，金粉私裁蛱蝶衣。\n记得小楼熏被夜，梦回宫烛照横枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42950,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠晦闻先生兰妻雀子","author":"曾习经","text":"人言林逋仙，无求自然足。\n一鹤与一梅，别成新眷属。\n我爱林逋翁，风趣更超俗。\n兰妻雀子呼，遥遥接芳躅。\n言真惬素心，好合曲栏曲。\n竟体挹芬芳，新妆照红烛。\n雪夜壁月眠，花貌想如玉。\n好鸟如佳儿，去来无拘束。\n得食性能驯，粒粒分仁粟。\n乍学鹦鹉鸣，旋随鸳鸯俗。\n臭味同妻兰，踊跃如童仆。\n翁乃左右顾，怡然遂所欲。\n有妻结良缘，有子绵似续。\n韵事比高贤，神似非刻鹄。\n胸怀天地宽，自处何荣辱。\n筑楼近韩居，窗开透辰旭。\n纵然小如舟，四围花作蓐。\n楼前一水通，漾漾涨春绿。\n借此乐馀年，欣欣忘蹐局。\n况复孙曾贤，泮芹屡掇渌。\n多福备箕畴，一一难纪录。\n快哉矍铄翁，高吟兴频触、","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42951,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙未二三月间六首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"春日迟迟夕，春愁许尔长。\n微歌意不适，薄醉未成狂。\n独下感时泪，兼之惜往伤。\n何当从年少，花草弄繁香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42952,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙未二三月间六首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"错落星垂户，依微月映楼。\n晚寒春尚浅，冰落水迟流。\n尘梦杳难记，乡愁散不收。\n如何南去雁，尚未一回头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42953,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙未二三月间六首 其三","author":"曾习经","text":"太息谁相语，搔头空弄姿。\n却看明镜里，讵是还山期。\n迟暮畏将及，芳情空尔为。\n葳蕤有兰叶，持以慰相思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42954,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙未二三月间六首 其四","author":"曾习经","text":"病起掩关坐，相存人未曾。\n不眠听夜漏，残渴饮春冰。\n著录参中垒，抽琴叹广陵。\n故园芳草色，惆怅已层层。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42955,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙未二三月间六首 其五","author":"曾习经","text":"著书无一字，揽鬓有千丝。\n似尔沉吟意，真成岁月驰。\n馀花犹窈窕，飞燕故差池。\n又是春芳晚，青云那可追。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42956,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙未二三月间六首 其六","author":"曾习经","text":"春晕一以照，芳草已寸碧。\n游子憺忘归，苍茫念行役。\n得途未欲忙，回首倏陈迹。\n官职岂足爱，劳劳至今夕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42957,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋斋五首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"一枕春愁似影烟，撩人秋色又今年。\n中庭已少閒花草，每到斜阳独惘然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42958,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋斋五首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"小苑秋深草树荒，一年芳物费评量。\n墙阴尽日无人到，袅袅斜风吹海棠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42959,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋斋五首 其三","author":"曾习经","text":"摇落纷纷不自持，几回惆怅晚芳时。\n虚檐不见閒蜂蝶，细看秋虫牵网丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42960,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋斋五首 其四","author":"曾习经","text":"新凉庭院少人行，灯火依稀不世情。\n一穗和烟媚幽独，花花草草可怜生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42961,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋斋五首 其五","author":"曾习经","text":"夜深簌簌坠梁尘，远寺残钟听未真。\n隙月斜明飞露脚，四更秋馆未眠人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42962,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题二首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"鹦鹉帘栊翡翠衾，依依凉月漏初沉。\n秋情细擘春蚕茧，残粉慵销瘦蝶金。\n绿篆有痕兰炷薄，红纱摇影桂屏深。\n女床合是栖鸾鸟，容易春丛不可寻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42963,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题二首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"停辛伫苦不辞难，尚有秾华补坠欢。\n夜月楼台风力软，秋星帘箔露华寒。\n故拈罗带摇环佩，自涴春衫近井阑。\n不种桃花种修竹，鸳雏时啄碧琅玕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42964,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"板阁二首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"板阁酒犹困，风屏灯欲摇。\n窥人有残月，流梦失春宵。\n桃叶迟淮水，杨花满谢桥。\n芳时幽怨极，梦巷响饧箫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42965,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"板阁二首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"漠漠弹花粉，喃喃坠燕泥。\n郁金香在袖，瑶玉冷妨肌。\n露井夭桃谢，风帘鹦鹉啼。\n断肠春不管，曾是雨凄凄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42966,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"失题七绝二首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"回首东风泪满巾，旧欢新梦觉无因。\n醒来正是黄昏雨，车马中原有暗尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42967,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"失题七绝二首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"落日黄沙塞草枯，朔风前夜雪平铺。\n汉唐遗垒模糊甚，还有阴山铁骑无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42968,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别任父二首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"楼头缺月夜向晓，骑马与君相送行。\n前路残春亦可惜，江南四月有啼莺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42969,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别任父二首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"夜半行郎柘弹空，阑珊春意各西东。\n他时独自亲调马，愁见山花故故红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42970,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江孝通归里二首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"忧愤终何补，倾危势已深。\n天心实仁爱，雪意况阴沉。\n不寐迟明发，临风寄远襟。\n孤根亦何赖，所得是知音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42971,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江孝通归里二首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"此日饮归客，前期送逐臣。\n眼看不得意，相顾各沾巾。\n莽莽春无主，凄凄去所亲。\n未应从屈贾，歌哭损天民。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42972,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丰化寺","author":"曾习经","text":"睡起凉痕落簟纹，远山清瘦似夫君。\n一龛禅寂上灯火，黄葛花开秋雨繁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42973,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"曾习经","text":"夜深官烛照无寐，一岁尘劳愧寝兴。\n风幔馀寒落衾枕，瓦沟残雪照春灯。\n江湖满地看年齿，车马朝天区殷輘。\n羁羽沉鳞说京国，梦中归雁在云层。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42974,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]